      "en": "For I am already being offered, and the time of my departure has come.",
      "ko": "관제와 같이 벌써 내가 부음이 되고 나의 떠날 기약이 가까왔도다",
      "source_text_hash": "fbe6ffbf4f6e5d3ca1b2167878eb43e72bd5db400eff926b48756ff3d872a666",
      "translation_text_hash": "0ebde8914a983a143df12da2899e5ebb69598c489304460d129a51918ec50b2a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
